Server init.
>> a := Blob yangi: 4.
a bytes: ( Roʻyxat yangi ; Bin b00000101 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000001 ; 0).
>> b := Blob yangi: 4.
b bytes: ( Roʻyxat yangi ; Bin b00000110 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000000 ; 0).
>> c := a yangi.
# inherited blob does not get the buffer, so it's useless
# it will pass ctr_accept() but since buffer ptr == null, it will return 0
{ Chiqish yozish: ( a ^ c ), yangi-qator. } ushlash: { :e Chiqish yozish: e, yangi-qator. }, ishga-tushirish.
a boʻshatish.
b boʻshatish.
